WEBVTT

00:04:26.538 --> 00:04:33.579
a situation in which it is possible to add
more resources to a course of action

00:04:33.621 --> 00:04:37.329
or a prior decision in order
to rectify a loss.

00:04:37.954 --> 00:04:40.329
Barry is the world's leading
expert on this problem,

00:04:40.996 --> 00:04:44.746
but even he can't help but fall victim
to escalation from time to time.

00:04:44.913 --> 00:04:49.038
I've had some old cars and then
when the warranty expires,

00:04:49.038 --> 00:04:52.079
then a bunch of little things
start going wrong and then

00:04:52.079 --> 00:04:54.871
a little bit bigger things going wrong
and then bigger and bigger.

00:04:54.871 --> 00:04:59.663
And I have been agonizing about
whether to actually sell it

00:04:59.996 --> 00:05:02.413
and get rid of it or put more money in.